nadian consulate had two sets of reps lol", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": true, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:30:05Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I think i am a quebec nationalist. Free quebec", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:30:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "When I was doing a project in Toronto, I went deep into the rabbit hole of Canadian constitutional evolution. Fascinating stuff", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:30:50Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I want revenge on justinder 🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:31:02Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "It’s very quirky", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:31:53Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The other day they had two speakers. One spoke on behalf of Canada. The other came and a 90% similar speech but with Canada swapped out for Quebec", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:36:49Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "I am a bit surprised still that Quebec didn't actually secede. Tensions seemed to have mellowed a bit now, based on conversations with Canadians. Apparently things were much more serious when Montreal was the biggest business hub of the country.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:39:40Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I s’pose demographics have also changed.. western provinces have gotten more powerful, both population wise and economically ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:40:06Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "It’s also surprising how little integrated canada is economically", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-08T23:40:15Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "There are many internal trade barriers", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]